        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-is-casein" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What Casein Is</a>
          <a href="#how-we-picked" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. How We Picked</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our Top Picks</a>
          <a href="#micellar-vs-caseinate" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Micellar vs Caseinate</a>
          <a href="#casein-before-bed" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Casein Before Bed</a>
          <a href="#casein-vs-whey" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Casein vs Whey</a>
          <a href="#how-much" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. How Much and When</a>
