          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Casein is the slow protein: it clots in the stomach and releases amino acids for hours, which makes it the right tool for a shake before bed, a long gap between meals or a thick protein pudding. Buy micellar casein, check that it leads the ingredient list, and aim for 30 to 40 g if you are taking it before sleep. Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard 100% Casein is the safest all-round pick, Dymatize Elite Casein gives a fuller dose, Naked Casein is the cook's choice, and NOW Sports Micellar Casein is the budget option with batch testing.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
